  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "凡在北國過過冬天的人，總都道圍爐煮茗，或吃煊羊肉，剝花生米，飲白乾的滋味。",
      "output_sha256": "9efe1e8510590bb283efa5d21c32db7304afa42c2d5d510b1f6fac233e3755a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "9efe1e8510590bb283efa5d21c32db7304afa42c2d5d510b1f6fac233e3755a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而有地爐，暖炕等設備的人家，不管它門外面是雪深幾尺，或風大若雷，而躲在屋裏過活的兩三個月的生活，卻是一年之中最有勁的一段蟄居異境；老年人不必說，就是頂喜歡活動的小孩子們，總也是個個在懷戀的，因爲當這中間，有的蘿蔔，雅兒梨等水果的閒食，還有大年夜，正月初一元宵等熱鬧的節期。",
      "output_sha256": "182bb33d6d585014d7f811628872d2daf2044d1d9e2802de6b96c6598e764a57",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "182bb33d6d585014d7f811628872d2daf2044d1d9e2802de6b96c6598e764a57",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但在江南，可又不同：冬至過後，大江以南的樹葉，也不至於脫盡。",
      "output_sha256": "b45aafd5c25caf17f71c584ee9979e9d878159c59b4c7b548e417e303a91f7bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "b45aafd5c25caf17f71c584ee9979e9d878159c59b4c7b548e417e303a91f7bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "寒風——西北風——間或吹來，至多也不過冷了一日兩日。",
      "output_sha256": "1805b40bddd332cbfe2074df9fa037dce161a4c375be5764fc57901750fd1aaa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "1805b40bddd332cbfe2074df9fa037dce161a4c375be5764fc57901750fd1aaa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "到得灰雲掃盡，落葉滿街，晨霜白得像黑女臉上的脂粉似的清早，太陽一上屋檐，鳥雀便又在吱叫，泥地裏便又放出水蒸氣來，老翁小孩就又可以上門前的隙地裏去坐着曝背談天，營屋外的生涯了；這一種江南的冬景，豈不也可愛得很麼?",
      "output_sha256": "b5b029ce1d42a53cae4ae7c9de284f3378443cde54dff30d52b4b09c293adb5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "b5b029ce1d42a53cae4ae7c9de284f3378443cde54dff30d52b4b09c293adb5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我生於江南，兒時對江南冬日的印象深刻。",
      "output_sha256": "107dc41625e4ae56465d1a2d6734848dd1280eb8a5c6491e165d0e95573dc9bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.609789,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c44a0c93509cab7eda78ab01bebcb8ed06bd3a4f90d7ce9e6936f8eca707756c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "107dc41625e4ae56465d1a2d6734848dd1280eb8a5c6491e165d0e95573dc9bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "雖然漸入中年後，我也愛上了晚秋，認為秋天是讀書寫字的最佳季節，但對江南的冬景，卻總覺得它有一種可以媲美北方夏夜的特殊韻味，若要現代一點形容，便是一種明亮而清新的情調。",
      "output_sha256": "e3e4ba76b8487e6952c72af9fe4b924e58f06a4ff755c3055991f9bfd02b1b95",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.609789,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c44a0c93509cab7eda78ab01bebcb8ed06bd3a4f90d7ce9e6936f8eca707756c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e3e4ba76b8487e6952c72af9fe4b924e58f06a4ff755c3055991f9bfd02b1b95",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我也曾到過閩粵，在那裏過冬天，和暖原極和暖，有時候到了陰曆的年邊，說不定還不得不拿出紗衫來着：走過野人的籬落，更還看得見許多雜七雜八的秋花！",
      "output_sha256": "8c8ab98978f3091001cce5dc9ec9e4b822df36bb2f44bdcd90694c5cfa5397ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "8c8ab98978f3091001cce5dc9ec9e4b822df36bb2f44bdcd90694c5cfa5397ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一番陣雨雷鳴過後，涼冷一點，至多也只好換上一件夾衣，在閩粵之間，皮袍棉襖是絕對用不着的！",
      "output_sha256": "71353af4ec922c8c5f561d32fca14a62fa7f00f1bfd97fc22f9bd4dfd75769b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "71353af4ec922c8c5f561d32fca14a62fa7f00f1bfd97fc22f9bd4dfd75769b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這一種極南的氣候異狀，並不是我所說的江南的冬景，只能叫它作南國的長春，是春或秋的延長。",
      "output_sha256": "51730acc94a14c81dd68da197f8c4e456311e3ba1030db0542308ec137ff9d03",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "51730acc94a14c81dd68da197f8c4e456311e3ba1030db0542308ec137ff9d03",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "江南的土壤豐饒而濕潤，能夠保持熱氣，滋養植物。",
      "output_sha256": "e58ffbc38321eb490e59f0f9bd468db85f86f9f952c5bcbb213230b4934c7ac1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.53945,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1bdd7947972f7982516f748613c1163573349e9acaf470ddf05f372ad36ad14c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e58ffbc38321eb490e59f0f9bd468db85f86f9f952c5bcbb213230b4934c7ac1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，長江沿岸，蘆花能在冬至時仍不凋謝，紅葉有時會延續三個月以上的生命。",
      "output_sha256": "19eb104b3858a2f522620a37aab52c31f154ff951f316946c2d7f6f5517ce05e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.53945,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1bdd7947972f7982516f748613c1163573349e9acaf470ddf05f372ad36ad14c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "19eb104b3858a2f522620a37aab52c31f154ff951f316946c2d7f6f5517ce05e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "像錢塘江兩岸的烏桕樹，紅葉掉落後，仍有雪白的桕子懸在樹枝上，若用相機拍攝，宛如梅花般美麗。",
      "output_sha256": "25f63d66fcd14dc7d3cdfd33c3677721e7b4da7a5ec0aa97c8150b65eb5e7b98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.571737,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d38077ace4db2839570c8c71744d36625fb847ca12957d5704d55e2959a6f33d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "25f63d66fcd14dc7d3cdfd33c3677721e7b4da7a5ec0aa97c8150b65eb5e7b98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "草色頂多成了赭色，根邊總帶點綠意，非但野火燒不盡，就是寒風也吹不倒的。",
      "output_sha256": "cf7ad9ff5cf733601e48ce14a348e7ed735d981308b4a61ba0eca4f1268d8118",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "cf7ad9ff5cf733601e48ce14a348e7ed735d981308b4a61ba0eca4f1268d8118",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "若遇到風和日暖的午後，你一個人肯上冬郊去走走，則青天碧落之下，你不但感不到歲時的肅殺，並且還可以飽覺着一種莫名其妙的含蓄在那裏的生氣：“若是冬天來了，春天也總馬上會來”的詩人的名句，只有在江南的山野裏，最容易體會得出。",
      "output_sha256": "b6f7734c5365a2ac3905fd10c5b35dc471a0a37925fa15767c1acbef2d30c852",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "b6f7734c5365a2ac3905fd10c5b35dc471a0a37925fa15767c1acbef2d30c852",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "說起了寒郊的散步，實在是江南的冬日，所給與江南居住者的一種特異的恩惠；在北方的冰天雪地裏生長的人，是終他的一生，也決不會有享受這一種清福的機會的。",
      "output_sha256": "11d9796208ba8783c2bdc94c31bd8c4f1577b880a0c0836d2508abfa93b72401",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "11d9796208ba8783c2bdc94c31bd8c4f1577b880a0c0836d2508abfa93b72401",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不知道德國的冬天，比起我們江浙來如何，但從許多作家的喜歡以Spaziergang一字來做他們的創造題目的一點看來，大約是德國南部地方，四季的變遷，總也和我們的江南差仿不多。",
      "output_sha256": "1ea1e8017c984f7ce946c944ea6fd6a4af85b9dad132143a6566bc6ca2a062cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "1ea1e8017c984f7ce946c944ea6fd6a4af85b9dad132143a6566bc6ca2a062cf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "例如十九世紀的鄉土詩人洛在格，他以“散步”為題材的文章特別多，所描述的情景，大多也可以用於中國江浙的山區。",
      "output_sha256": "318305ff94fee75ad39c7318883b6f2a63b9ccd37819daa4850a380c6a11e89b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.404927,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a1c3a95686ca1dd9b15d59f69b21ddc0b28f7877d4a8071620294b5e9792c0c9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "318305ff94fee75ad39c7318883b6f2a63b9ccd37819daa4850a380c6a11e89b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "江南河港交流，且又地濱大海，湖沼特多，故空氣裏時含水分；到得冬天，不時也會下着微雨，而這微雨寒村裏的冬霖景象，又是一種說不出的悠閒境界。",
      "output_sha256": "35a4f7fdba44d072e72c9f5637aa353903bffe3ff8be5b1ff692b209284141b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "35a4f7fdba44d072e72c9f5637aa353903bffe3ff8be5b1ff692b209284141b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你試想想，秋收過後，河流邊三五家人家會聚在一道的一個小村子裏，門對長橋，窗臨遠阜，這中間又多是樹枝槎丫的雜木樹林；在這一幅冬日農村的圖上，再灑上一層細得同粉也似的白雨，加上一層淡得幾不成墨的背景，你說還夠不夠悠閒?",
      "output_sha256": "1aea6f21037d00a9a59d62a7d0a7d735fbdbbbaeeb06b64c78391d4998100f5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "1aea6f21037d00a9a59d62a7d0a7d735fbdbbbaeeb06b64c78391d4998100f5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "若再要點景緻進去，則門前可以泊一隻烏篷小船，茅屋裏可以添幾個喧譁的酒客，天垂暮了，還可以加一味紅黃，在茅屋窗中畫上一圈暗示着燈光的月暈。",
      "output_sha256": "a72e663fba28189cb74aa40205d812a3cdd35a632857f3a059a409c755fa573c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "a72e663fba28189cb74aa40205d812a3cdd35a632857f3a059a409c755fa573c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "人置於此境，自然心胸開闊，最終對得失了無所謂，生死也不再重要。",
      "output_sha256": "a70efaa7fa8d8f50835ea8f890672850ed1fed2ef431c05c25549d0b97259dc0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.457939,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a360100cffeb1aabcf4b1a48606838c9ed04205edb0336cae972e22d0866c6b1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a70efaa7fa8d8f50835ea8f890672850ed1fed2ef431c05c25549d0b97259dc0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26,
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們應當記得唐朝詩人所作的“暮雨瀟瀟江上村”吧？",
      "output_sha256": "9b7c772d3d36a9af019f9a65b777c7320e51cba435955e0e0adbe623e6e15ba3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.457939,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a360100cffeb1aabcf4b1a48606838c9ed04205edb0336cae972e22d0866c6b1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9b7c772d3d36a9af019f9a65b777c7320e51cba435955e0e0adbe623e6e15ba3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26,
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "詩人到此，連對綠林豪客都客氣起來了，這不是江南冬景的迷人又是什麼?",
      "output_sha256": "b41e7ea60635e8b470ec9ee7f2da22bbdb12a2ed19a6a2ec6a322607609a8ddc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "b41e7ea60635e8b470ec9ee7f2da22bbdb12a2ed19a6a2ec6a322607609a8ddc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一提到雨，也就必然的要想到雪：“晚來天欲雪，能飲一杯無?”",
      "output_sha256": "f6701e6e2650751d4b381e8219c9c3f87515ef8e8fb2e219d60d3fc5b4d38c3f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6701e6e2650751d4b381e8219c9c3f87515ef8e8fb2e219d60d3fc5b4d38c3f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自然是江南日暮的雪景。",
      "output_sha256": "5461a23d49ef47d35245ca6412c82d40ca9e8355ecc67b6b23bd1046be98674f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "5461a23d49ef47d35245ca6412c82d40ca9e8355ecc67b6b23bd1046be98674f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“寒沙梅影路，微雪酒香村”，則雪月梅的冬宵三友，會合在一道，在調戲酒姑娘了。",
      "output_sha256": "c8c2bbd1030d5ac9a81fb9fe2d2154b5f59c9d8bbb3be468b5ca209e0106a79d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8c2bbd1030d5ac9a81fb9fe2d2154b5f59c9d8bbb3be468b5ca209e0106a79d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“柴門村犬吠，風雪夜歸人”，是江南雪夜，更深人靜後的景況。",
      "output_sha256": "2a80717cb43de19e614b1e9549a299a320fffe4901910314ab2162b00025bfe0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a80717cb43de19e614b1e9549a299a320fffe4901910314ab2162b00025bfe0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“前樹深雪裏，昨夜一枝開”，又到了第二天的早晨，喜歡玩雪的村童們來報告村莊的景象。",
      "output_sha256": "ebdae37050b1c20e1fd6a08ec23e0c536ee510177c4276b942e07be228493c2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.770181,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3b6f79093caaee53d00d493ee4babba178a943e75c234f356e03f9c795f0dd78"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ebdae37050b1c20e1fd6a08ec23e0c536ee510177c4276b942e07be228493c2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "詩人的詩句，也許不盡是在江南所寫，而做這幾句詩的詩人，也許不盡是江南人，但假了這幾句詩來描寫江南的雪景，豈不直截了當，比我這一枝愚劣的筆所寫的散文更美麗得多?",
      "output_sha256": "306844031d2269619f7ee29267dc47cc8e9ab8b332aa40ff674c138bb0a32e08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "306844031d2269619f7ee29267dc47cc8e9ab8b332aa40ff674c138bb0a32e08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有幾年，在江南，在江南也許會沒有雨沒有雪的過一個冬，到了春間陰曆的正月底或二月初再冷一冷下一點春雪的；去年(1934)的冬天是如此，今年的冬天恐怕也不得不然，以節氣推算起來，大約大冷的日子，將在1936年的2月盡頭，最多也總不過是七八天的樣子。",
      "output_sha256": "793eb8c4621dd6e6079f4b6981d5c64f949ae2eea9ec658e8398a92bf50c4a26",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "793eb8c4621dd6e6079f4b6981d5c64f949ae2eea9ec658e8398a92bf50c4a26",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這樣的冬天，鄉下人稱之為旱冬，對於小麥的收成或許有好處，但對人口卻會造成損害。",
      "output_sha256": "3d5607fce772d3435de9a3e93e16d46beca17fc0de8b963b293b40d557c5c599",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.68858,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "22ce69b9b60688c81d673d6810904b4842cc5f088fa697d6517cd2d9beffee46"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3d5607fce772d3435de9a3e93e16d46beca17fc0de8b963b293b40d557c5c599",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36,
        37,
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "旱得久了，白喉、流感等疾病自然容易上身；但若想盡情享受江南的冬景，在這樣的冬天，倒是能得到一些快樂，因為晴和的日子多了，上郊外散步的機會自然也多。",
      "output_sha256": "df1877f255f3f725a32eef2848faba55655f3b56a7e93cb3014bd429325b5b6a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.68858,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "22ce69b9b60688c81d673d6810904b4842cc5f088fa697d6517cd2d9beffee46"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "df1877f255f3f725a32eef2848faba55655f3b56a7e93cb3014bd429325b5b6a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36,
        37,
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "日本人稱之為Hiking，德國人稱之為Spaziergang的狂熱者，所最喜愛的也就是這樣的冬天。",
      "output_sha256": "e2d0ca2f0c5b82735c2a9adecb65a712e07586cb0d090afa9ddea9002091c2db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.68858,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "22ce69b9b60688c81d673d6810904b4842cc5f088fa697d6517cd2d9beffee46"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e2d0ca2f0c5b82735c2a9adecb65a712e07586cb0d090afa9ddea9002091c2db",
